From: Xbox360 Blades <xbox360-blades@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 10:36:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 07/56] Guide overlay: the 2.0.2858.0 Guide

- Menu focus follows the scenes' own navigation graph from layout.txt
  (up/down/left/right; the signed-out menu now hosts the mini media player).
- Pages are drawn as single-pass composites with the chrome (additive
  lines), crossfading from the chrome while they fade in.
- Battery icon for a wireless controller at its charge level, none for a
  wired one (new InputSystem::GetBatteryLevel, SDL power level).
- Clock in the host's 12/24-hour format.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AFb8CDFE1Ms5NnJH88eG8b
